      approves it before it runs.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn" href="#crm">See the first product: the CRM</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#install">Install it</a>
    </div>
    <p class="sub2">
      Source available, free to self-host. <a class="textlink" href="#platform">What the platform does</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
